direction: right
failure: Recorded dependency failures
setup: Existing CI dependency step
core: Unchanged platform core commands
tests: Unchanged platform tests
remote: Actual GitHub result / separate observation
failure -> setup -> core -> tests -> remote
sysml: SysML source scope
ascent: ASCENT publication gates
preflight: Parsed YAML comparison and rejection controls
sysml -> ascent
preflight -> ascent
ascent -> remote: qualified change published
